    "fullSolution": "Let $u = \\sin(x)$, $du = \\cos(x)dx$\\n\\n$\\int \\sin(x)\\cos(x)dx = \\int u\\,du = \\frac{u^2}{2} + C = \\frac{\\sin^2(x)}{2} + C$",
